give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"Why. Won't. You. Die?!\"", "italic": true, "color": "red"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Sailor", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose an alive player: either you or they are drunk until dusk. You can't die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Oracle", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, you learn how many dead players are evil."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Monk", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player (not yourself): they are safe from the Demon tonight."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Minstrel", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhen a Minion dies by execution, all other players (except Travellers) are drunk until dusk tomorrow."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fool", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nThe 1st time you die, you don't."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Pacifist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nExecuted good players might not die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Sweetheart", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhen you die, 1 player is drunk from now on."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Plague Doctor", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhen you die, the Storyteller gains a Minion ability."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Devil's Advocate", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose a living player (different to last night): if executed tomorrow, they don't die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Mastermind", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nIf the Demon dies by execution (ending the game), play for 1 more day. If a player is then executed, their team loses."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Zombuul", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, if no-one died today, choose a player: they die. The 1st time you die, you live but register as dead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Lleech", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. You start by choosing a player: they are poisoned. You die if & only if they are dead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bone Collector", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nOnce per game, at night*, choose a dead player: they regain their ability until dusk."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Apprentice", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nOn your 1st night, you gain a Townsfolk ability (if good) or a Minion ability (if evil)."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Deviant", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nIf you were funny today, you cannot die by exile."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Scapegoat", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nIf a player of your alignment is executed, you might be executed instead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Voudon", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nOnly you & the dead can vote. They don't need a vote token to do so. A 50% majority isn't required."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Sentinel", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nThere might be 1 extra or 1 fewer Outsider in play."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Djinn", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nUse the Djinn's special rule. All players know what it is. (Speak with Storyteller.)"]],title:"Why. Won't. You. Die?! Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "Why. Won't. You. Die?! Script", "italic": false, "color": "red", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"Why. Won't. You. Die?!\"", "italic": false, "color": "red"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]